<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes continue in Bangui among government forces, former Séléka rebels, Anti‑balaka militias and foreign actors. A planned large‑scale militant attack was foiled, indicating rebel groups still retain the capacity to organize major operations. The conflict remains entrenched, sustaining instability across the country. There were 246 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQR2VkUk0wRDJ1SlVqemhnekJqVDAtMEtFTUlFU3pydXVvWlN1enV6OF9TNFlzZ2k3dmZoT25KakZ6NjhPcmNZaURkaWY4cWxxUGNVV0tVempSbjhhVGgyaFkwTEQ3cHV0ZS1GYVdNSjFmTzVuZ0R2dWQ1ei1TZ051LWI4N2ZGRVVWd2JQOFVqekU0LWRmcWl3RnNIR1k2TTJZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5xaE90ZFQ3d0ZsdXloQXJYNk04Q0U0NTJ0SFVzeVBYTzRYVXFPMUhLNlI3OHpaSUQ0TGtkZ296dEd1VGlDZ0g0X3ltOWJFUFB4SzJCdTFhbVNCX25GZzNQaF9iMnItdnZtWVNBSmxrWUhSMDlBX2pCMkdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Lafayette Sports Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPUmdhR0pvYlc5elloaTJXd3pnV3BzS0x1NzFZamx5VGZsU3pfNlEwZGlBVlBBcjcyV3NwUjU0V2xMVDIwR3RDVDNmbHk1Q2VEVGJETmNzeHFKUzdXZTBGMFhSb2lWSmxrUHNnYjhOZWJ4dlFhS0daVjlnUUlFQkJ6NHhzc1huLXFWY1oxOTVyeDk1b1JyYUpoMnYzR0lKM1RJZUJOMHRDdlA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNTExRejBTUHBxdmU4UnJkcE8tM05XbU1GUUJubGxfVy13a3FhUmtZQjdwN01uNDBlZkZkWGVBcWowZVZlbkpyU251dFI2QnFKX093NHlGWHpHSEtDUGdMWXd2Y2NtYi1TWWw0RUZaTFlzZ3JIT3RIR0tuYVVvdXV2eUdUM0wxQ29hWlFkb0REdjRYRjVlOEd5ZW9wLWJ5OWE3eGI2ejhDaG52ZGtK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Scranton Times-Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPZ1d2ZHlWckYtaWgtRTFpUlNMWTBiRllNMzV5ZWlzVjR4